  "rationale": "122 units of Cream Bun 200G at Outlet 03 (South Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-15; doing nothing writes off ₹6187 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹2971. This play uses a bundle with SKU-CURD-500ML at ₹115 for 330 consented customers (Personal care regulars, Tea connoisseurs, Everyday staples shoppers, Sweets occasionals, Premium Tea regulars, Household essentials buyers): expected 33 units, margin ₹327, discount cost ₹501, waste avoided ₹1694 (CI 2 to 97 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs the Cream Bun with Curd 500ML at a bundle price of 115 INR, satisfying the 8% bakery margin floor while recovering 326.65 INR in margin and avoiding waste.",
